        <selectionEntryGroup name="Hunting Lance" id="e2c3-9b3a-fe2d-473c" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="2">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="2229-5b56-5572-7fc7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="4" />
          </constraints>
          <modifierGroups>
            <modifierGroup>
              <comment>This logic may seem odd. What happens is that when # of RRs is 5, the max number of lances shoots up to 9. By subtracting by 4 when we reach five, we counteract the fact it adds in four extra lances. We cannot set the max to 0 because it does not display the option to select lances without it being a max &gt; 0.</comment>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="2229-5b56-5572-7fc7" type="increment" value="1">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="586c-4bb2-3740-50c3" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="greaterThan" value="4" />
                  </conditions>
                  <repeats>
                    <repeat childId="586c-4bb2-3740-50c3" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" repeats="1" roundUp="false" scope="parent" shared="true" value="1" />
                  </repeats>
                </modifier>
                <modifier field="2229-5b56-5572-7fc7" type="decrement" value="1">
                  <repeats>
                    <repeat childId="012b-39bf-6c1e-1344" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" repeats="1" roundUp="false" scope="parent" shared="true" value="1" />
                  </repeats>
                </modifier>
                <modifier field="2229-5b56-5572-7fc7" type="decrement" value="4">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="586c-4bb2-3740-50c3" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="greaterThan" value="4" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </modifierGroup>
          </modifierGroups>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Hunting Lance" id="90cb-c39f-694e-b038" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
