          <rules>
            <rule id="79ba-9754-1e05-f4ba" name="Medi-pack" hidden="false">
              <description>Medi-packs allow a unit with a medic to ignore the first failed saving throw it rolls in every turn. The medi-pack may not be used on any model which suffers instant death or that has been hit by a close combat weapon that allows no Armour save. It may not be used if the medic is in base contact with an enemy model.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
