                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">Roll a D6 for each Penal Legion squad in your army before deployment, to determine each squad's specialist skill.


1-2  Gunslingers: Lasguns are treated as being Assault 2, not Rapid Fire.


3-4  Psychopaths: The squad have the Counter-Attack, Fleet and Furious Charge special rules.


5-6  Knife Fighters: The squad are counted as having an extra close combat weapon in addition to their normal wargear. In addition, close combat attacks made by the Penal Legionnaires have the Rending special rule.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink targetId="ffa6-3c47-a648-85dd" id="74ab-f44e-7b5c-5ded" type="profile" name="Penal Legionnaries" hidden="false" />
                <infoLink name="Lasgun" id="be14-65a5-20e8-b4c2" hidden="false" type="profile" targetId="3d2e-5448-edbf-a00a" />
                <infoLink name="Close-Combat Weapon" id="c9bd-66e9-7f81-805d" hidden="false" type="profile" targetId="662b-09f1-bd5b-b334" />
              </infoLinks>
              <constraints>
