                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">If a model with a slabshield is in base contact with one or more models with a slabshield from the same unit, it adds +1 to its Armour Save. Furthermore, if a target (friend or foe) is partially obscured from the firer’s view by at least one model with a slabshield, it receives +1 to its cover save.</characteristic>
